<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0219_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...Yaaaaaaawn.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...\n...\rYaaaaawn...\n...\rHuh? What?! Is it already that late?!\nOh no! I overslept!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...\n...\rHmm. Looks like the sun is descending\nin the sky...\r...So this would be what is called\n“twilight,” wouldn’t it?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...\n...\rHmm... Interesting...\n...\rHuh? Oh! Excuse me, sorry!\nI was just reading this book here.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...Yaaaaaaawn.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sorry to keep you waiting!\rWelcome to the world of IronMON!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">IronMON Community Discord:     \ndiscord.gg/jFPYsZAhjX  \n\nFind the Rando here, as well as  \nsettings, rules, and more  \nBe nice!   </language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">\nBig thanks to SilverstarStream for\ncreating the Intro Skip patch that\nthis was built on and to Fouton for\nmaking the IronMON HGSS logos!\n\nAlso huge thanks to UTDZac,\nOnlySpaghettiCode, Fellshadow,\nBesteon, BurninTheBlues, &amp;\nninjafriend for their work on the\nNDS IronMON Tracker!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I would also like to thank Ajarmar\nand darkeye for their work on the\nUniversal Pokemon Randomizer\nused for the challenge, even if it\nwas a pain to get this patch to\nbe compatible with it lol.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Also, I have to thank TerribleTavi &amp;\nGalacticElliot for introducing me to\nto the IronMON challenge. I have\nmet so many amazing people\nbecause of you two and I will\nalways be thankful.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Of course, I also have to thank\niateyourpie for starting the\nIronMON challenge and for\nsomehow getting me to spend\nmonths of my life resetting in\nthe lab. One day I’ll finally beat\nKaizo, but probably not any time\nsoon lol</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語"></language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I would also be mad at myself if\nI didn’t thank Crozwords and the\nother legends in the IronMON\nTourney Discord Server for\nteaching me a lot about HGSS\nand giving me some of the best\nfeedback that I have gotten for\nthis patch.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">These legends include Sentor_G,\nYogiEisbar, StreamingFalcon,\nPotatoOnCrack, AmeSoso,\neiphzor, Skapp_tv, Pringoler,\nglifosfato, Asaye_, SnarfEsq,\nLB_Dubss, and JTMagicman!\n\nThank you all so much for your\nfeedback and bug reports!\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I also want to credit to MajinPhil\nand his mod markdean for their\nsuggestions as well, especially\non some of the more recent\nupdates to the patch. It was\nfun to work on some of the\nmore technically demanding\nsuggestions I got from you guys.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If you ended up reading this\nthank you so much for using\nthe patch. It’s been crazy to\nsee how many people have used\nthis patch and it makes all the\neffort I’ve put into making this\nfeel worth it. Good luck on your\nrun! Hopefully this is the one\nthat gets to beat Red. -PyroMike</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語"></language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語"></language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語"></language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語"></language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語"></language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I also want to thank the amazing\npeople in the Kingdom of DS\nHacking Discord Server for all\nthe help they’ve given me in\nunderstanding how NDS games\nwork and how to modify them.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語"></language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00025" index="25">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Big thanks to AdAstra for making\nthe tools I used for the patch!{YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00026" index="26">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Alright, that’s enough mushy talk.\nTime to go back to the lab. {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00027" index="27">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00028" index="28">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The IronMON Rules Pastebin:   \nThis link now includes all modes\npastebin.com/L48bttfz.     </language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00029" index="29">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Here is the discord link again: \ndiscord.gg/jFPYsZAhjX - Be Nice!\n                \nFind any info or resources       \nyou might need here.  </language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00030" index="30">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The journey will be a challenge\nand you may need all the help you\ncan find for an advantage.      </language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00031" index="31">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">At times, you will be challenged\nby others to a battle.\nAt other times, wild creatures\nmay stand in your way.\n\nBe sure to use items wisely\nand take the right risks. </language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00032" index="32">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">However, your adventure is not\nsolely about becoming powerful.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00033" index="33">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">On your travels, we hope that\nthrough the toughest times you\nwill persevere and enjoy  \nthis challenge. \n\nThis is the most important\nobjective of this adventure.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00034" index="34">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Let’s get this over with.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00035" index="35">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Up Up Down Down Left Right\nLeft Right B A Start\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00036" index="36">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Quick question...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00037" index="37">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Are you a boy?\nOr are you a girl? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00038" index="38">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">So, you’re a boy then? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00039" index="39">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">So, you’re a girl then? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00040" index="40">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Please tell me your name.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00041" index="41">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Your name is {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00042" index="42">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Your name is {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00043" index="43">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Good luck on the run {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r</language>
	</row>
